023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 108\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 109\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 111\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/plain-waffles-35744\" title=\"Plain waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plain waffles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/pineapple-coconut-bars-35898\" title=\"Pineapple coconut bars\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pineapple coconut bars\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/plain-waffles-35744\" title=\"Plain Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plain Waffles</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/pineapple-coconut-bars-35898\" title=\"Pineapple Coconut Bars\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pineapple Coconut<br>Bars</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/ff/White_Sugar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240205163815\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Sugar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/ff/White_Sugar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240205163815\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Sugar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 114\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 120\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Boat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Boat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150712182459\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/media/File%3ARiverboat.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Boat</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders require 1 to 8 bags of white sugar per crate, up to a total of 24 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>White sugar is something you need to constantly have on hand. Many players have argued that one sugar mill was not enough to cover their needs. This tells you how often this product is used. After years of waiting, we finally got a second one, available at level 76.</li>\n<li>You can't expect to find sugar in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>. Selling it, even at maximum price, is not worth it. Make something with it, and sell those instead.</li>\n<li><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">White Sugar</strong> is often used in conjunction with <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a>'s product like Cream and Butter, plus Milk to create intermediary like <a href=\"/wiki/lemon-curd-10558\" title=\"Lemon Curd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lemon curd</a>, which is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/lemon-pie-10559\" title=\"Lemon Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lemon pies</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/lemon-cake-10560\" title=\"Lemon Cake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lemon cakes</a>. At higher level, you will need to this to create <a href=\"/wiki/plain-donut-34940\" title=\"Plain Donut\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plain Donut</a>, which in turn feed into other products of the same machine.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The label on the bag says 'Supasugar', like it does on <a href=\"/wiki/brown-sugar-2095\" title=\"Brown Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">brown sugar</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-sugar-mill-products-7555\" title=\"Category:Sugar Mill Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sugar Mill Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/brown-sugar-2095\" title=\"Brown Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Brown Sugar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/syrup-2272\" title=\"Syrup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Syrup\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/white-sugar-2096\" title=\"White Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Sugar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831072453\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.135 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.204 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 802/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19831/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 482/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1278613/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.365      1 -total\n 64.18%   47.729      1 Template:Infobox\n 28.57%   21.243     10 Template:Infoicon\n 18.35%   13.646      1 Template:Navigation\n 11.77%    8.750      1 Template:SugarMillMenu\n  8.07%    6.002      1 Template:Item_Usage\n  2.71%    2.012      1 Template:Languages\n  2.03%    1.510      4 Template:Clr\n  1.99%    1.479      1 Template:PageDisplay\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:2096-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831072453 and revision id 108530. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
